  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "品牌與設計管理",
    "sub_ename": "BRAND AND DESIGN MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "在商業空間與視覺形象整合已成為趨勢，透過商業空間和品牌的形象展示，藉由系統化陳列展示與顧客溝通，向顧客傳達室內空間訊息、服務理念和品牌文化，以達到促進商品銷售，進而建立品牌形象為目的。本課程強調“空間與商品視覺化”吸引消費者產生興趣，進而誘導消費達到提高商品銷售的目的！透過本課程的學習，將可讓同學更清楚地瞭解在設計產業中行銷重要性，有別於商業空間設計之視覺形象。",
    "describe_eh": "The integration of commercial space and visual image has become a trend. Through the display of commercial space and brand image, through systematic display and communication with customers, we convey indoor space information, service concept and brand culture to customers to promote the sale of goods. Establish a brand image for the purpose. This course emphasizes that “space and merchandise visualization” attracts consumers to generate interest, and then induces consumption to achieve the purpose of improving merchandise sales! Through this course, students will be able to understand more clearly the importance of marketing in the design industry, which is different from the visual image of commercial space design.",
